		"Cuff Breaker ($15,000)\nMask ($5,000)\nBlindfold ($5,000)\nRope ($5,000)\nLockpick ($10,000)\nWeapon Clip ($1,000)\nPen Drive ($10,000)\nLaptop ($10,000)\nHotwire Kit ($34,513)\nMobile Meth Lab ($10,000)\nMaterials x100 ($10,000)\nPot 10g ($10,000)\nOre ($10,000)\nGold ($25,000)\nGun Frame ($50,000)\nPistol Frame ($75,000)\nRifle Frame ($150,000)\nMetal Parts x10 ($20,000)\nGun Powder x10 ($20,000)\nWeapon Kit ($25,000)\nCopper ($10,000)\nEphedrine ($10,000)\nMuriatic Acid ($5,000)\nCigars x10 ($5,000)\nGas Can ($5,000)",
		"Buy", "Cancel");
